      "id": 261435,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-11-05T17:13:10.791Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Is he about to ramble all over some guys? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/eyes.png?v=12\" title=\":eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eyes:\"></p>\n<p>Oh! I was fully willing to believe they’d done 4.5 hours of prep!</p>\n<p>RIP all the Rambler/Biomancer shippers</p>\n<p>Flesh bats! Sure! Normal stuff!</p>\n<p>Oh boy, no hands time! A hand he can no longer trust? Surely nothing horrible will come of that!</p>\n<p>So, alligator skin! And Rotting God Gloomweaver has an alligator tail! Coincidence?</p>\n<p>Yeah, this is really feeling like more than one issue by now.</p>\n<p>So, Rambler vs. the Ennead, right? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/eyes.png?v=12\" title=\":eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eyes:\"> <em>Right?</em></p>\n<p>Gloomweaver vs. Biomancer? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> Now that’s an unexpected bonus treat.</p>\n<p>A letter from the theme music itself! Fascinating! XD</p>\n<p>Oh man, Zhu Long favor <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"> Can <em>we</em> cash it in to learn more about him, I wonder? XD</p>\n<p>That’s exactly what a Biomancer clone would say!</p>\n<p>I believe the correct plural is Las Capitán. :V</p>\n<p>Ah, so she learns that split happens.</p>\n<p>And there it is, Adam told us we’d hear the moment where he doomed himself! XD</p>",
