      "raw": "Is he about to ramble all over some guys? :eyes:\n\nOh! I was fully willing to believe they'd done 4.5 hours of prep!\n\nRIP all the Rambler/Biomancer shippers\n\nFlesh bats! Sure! Normal stuff!\n\nOh boy, no hands time! A hand he can no longer trust? Surely nothing horrible will come of that!\n\nSo, alligator skin! And Rotting God Gloomweaver has an alligator tail! Coincidence?\n\nYeah, this is really feeling like more than one issue by now.\n\nSo, Rambler vs. the Ennead, right? :eyes: *Right?*\n\nGloomweaver vs. Biomancer? :D Now that's an unexpected bonus treat.\n\nA letter from the theme music itself! Fascinating! XD\n\nOh man, Zhu Long favor :O Can *we* cash it in to learn more about him, I wonder? XD\n\nThat's exactly what a Biomancer clone would say!\n\nI believe the correct plural is Las Capitán. :V\n\nAh, so she learns that split happens.\n\nAnd there it is, Adam told us we'd hear the moment where he doomed himself! XD",
